  "scene2Beat1": "Create your Astraea self: allocate eight Attributes and choose a starting weapon.",
  "scene2Beat2": "Each Attribute starts at Base 8; allocate 32 points; starting cap 15.",
  "scene2Beat3": "Life Progress represents your history of investment, not a rating of your real-world ability.",
  "scene3Beat1": "Magic is not a wish. Magic is a method of transforming World State A into B.",
  "scene3Beat2": "f(S0)=S1",
  "scene3Beat3": "Function Graph: Gather(Energy) → Shape(Bolt) → Move(Target). Tap a node to inspect its role in the spell sequence.",
